10 REM CPM85 STAGE C1 NATIVE UI + BASIC KEY PUMP
20 REM EXPERIMENTAL - LEAVES LEGACY CPM UNCHANGED
30 REM REQUIRES LOADBIN CPM85 V0.05A
40 REM STOP OLD CPM CAPTURE WITH K8 FIRST
50 REM DISABLE PRTKEYS 1 WITH PRTKEYS 0
